 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "hi i need help!! my internet is barely working and my bill is way too high this month 😡",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Thanks for contacting Nimbus Telecom. I'm Meera. I'm sorry to hear you're having trouble. I can certainly help you with that today.",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we dive into the account, could you please provide your account number and date of birth for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "sure, account is 72265799 and dob is 21/05/1994",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Emily Reddy. I can see your account. I totally understand how frustrating it is when your connection is slow and the bill doesn't look right. Let me check this for you.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "thanks. my phone is 95169 78206 and email is emily.61@examplemail.com just in case you need them.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Got it. Looking at the network status, there's a signal issue in your area. I'll raise a network ticket right now to get this prioritized for the engineers.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "okay, hope it gets fixed soon. what about the bill? i was charged twice for the premium package.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I see the error. I will raise a refund request for that duplicate charge immediately.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please note that any credit is subject to approval and usually takes 7-10 business days to appear in your account.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "that sounds fair. thanks for sorting this out so quickly!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome! To recap, I've raised a network ticket for your internet and a refund request for the overcharge. Is there anything else I can help you with today? If not, have a great day!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "nope that's all. thanks meera! bye 👋",
      "tags": []
    }
  ]
}
